% Regression test for https://github.com/knowsys/nemo/issues/662: a base
% IRI next to an import. The base used to be applied to the `csv` before
% the import's options, which failed to parse.

@base <https://example.org/> .

@import input from csv { resource = "sources/input.csv" }.

result(?x, ?y) :- input(?x, ?y).
